  "details": "let's say you make an invite only world instance, and in that world there is a portal to another world pre-placed in that that world. if you enter that portal, i think it should automatically send you into an instance of the world in that portal of the same privacy rating. for example, with the way it is now, i make that invite only world, go into another portal frrom that world that i'm in, and then suddenly i'm in a public instance despite the fact that my previous instance was invite only. with my proposal, invite only world portals would be also invite only.",
